\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ##\cf4 \strokec4  Context
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\
1xbet offers Klondike solitaire with a \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 2x payout\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  on wins. The rules are: draw-1, unlimited passes through the stock, no undo, standard 52-card deck, 7 tableau columns, only kings fill empty columns. To break even at 2x, you need a \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 >50% win rate\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 .\
\
Research findings:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Theoretical solvability (Thoughtful Klondike, draw-1, unlimited passes): ~82\'9691%\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  \'97 this is with perfect information (all cards visible)\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Best documented human win rate (no undo): ~43%\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  (Jupiter Scientific, 442 games)\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Average player win rate: ~33%\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  (Solitaired.com, 2.9M games)\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Best heuristic computer solver: ~52.9\'9653.4%\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  (Bill Turnbull, 10M games)\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 State-of-the-art AI (Lonelybot HOP/MCTS, draw-3): 47.58% \'b1 0.80%\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  \'97 draw-1 estimated a few points higher\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Industry slot RTP for comparison: 93\'9697%\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5  (house edge 3\'967%). This solitaire game has an effective RTP of 66\'9686% depending on skill (house edge 14\'9634%).\
\
\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Goal\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 : Empirically determine the exact win rate for draw-1 unlimited-pass Klondike under imperfect information using solvers, and evaluate whether any exploitable edge exists.\
\
\cf2 \strokec2 ---\cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

