\cf2 \strokec2 2.\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Understand the codebase structure\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 \
   \cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf6 \strokec6 `lonelybot/`\cf5 \strokec5  \'97 core engine library (game state, solver logic, MCTS)\
   \cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf6 \strokec6 `lonecli/`\cf5 \strokec5  \'97 CLI wrapper binary\
   \cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Key files to examine: game state representation, move generation, solver modes\
