\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ###\cf4 \strokec4  EV Calculations
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 ```\cf5 \strokec5 \
EV per bet = (win_rate \'d7 payout) - 1\
\
Where:\
- win_rate = decimal (0.0 to 1.0)\
- payout = 2.0 (2x on win, lose stake on loss)\
\
Breakeven: win_rate = 0.50\
\
Examples:\
- 33% win rate \uc0\u8594  EV = 0.33 \'d7 2 - 1 = -0.34 (lose 34\'a2 per \u8369 1 bet)\
- 43% win rate \uc0\u8594  EV = 0.43 \'d7 2 - 1 = -0.14 (lose 14\'a2 per \u8369 1 bet)\
- 50% win rate \uc0\u8594  EV = 0.50 \'d7 2 - 1 = 0.00 (breakeven)\
- 53% win rate \uc0\u8594  EV = 0.53 \'d7 2 - 1 = +0.06 (win 6\'a2 per \u8369 1 bet)\
\cf2 \strokec2 ```\cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ###\cf4 \strokec4  Hourly Rate Analysis
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\
Even if marginally +EV, time cost matters:\
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 ```\cf5 \strokec5 \
hourly_ev = (ev_per_bet \'d7 bet_size \'d7 games_per_hour)\
\
Assumptions:\
- Average game duration: 5\'9615 minutes\
- Games per hour: 4\'9612\
- Bet size: variable (min \uc0\u8369 1, max \u8369 35,150.60)\
\
Example at 53% win rate, \uc0\u8369 100 bet, 6 games/hour:\
hourly_ev = 0.06 \'d7 100 \'d7 6 = \uc0\u8369 36/hour\
\
Example at 43% win rate, \uc0\u8369 100 bet, 6 games/hour:\
hourly_ev = -0.14 \'d7 100 \'d7 6 = -\uc0\u8369 84/hour\
\cf2 \strokec2 ```\cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ###\cf4 \strokec4  Variance & Bankroll Requirements
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 ```\cf5 \strokec5 \
For a binary outcome (win 1x or lose 1x):\
- Variance per game = win_rate \'d7 (1 - win_rate) \'d7 payout\'b2\
- Standard deviation per game \uc0\u8776  1.0 (roughly)\
- For N games: SD = sqrt(N) \'d7 per_game_SD\
\
Kelly Criterion (if +EV):\
- Optimal bet fraction = (b\'d7p - q) / b\
  where b = net payout odds (1:1), p = win prob, q = lose prob\
- At 53%: kelly = (1\'d70.53 - 0.47) / 1 = 0.06 (bet 6% of bankroll)\
\cf2 \strokec2 ```\cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

