\f0\b\fs18 \cf2 \strokec2 #\cf4 \strokec4  Klondike Solitaire Solver: 1xbet EV Analysis Project
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ##\cf4 \strokec4  Objective
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\
Empirically determine the win rate of Klondike Solitaire under 1xbet's exact ruleset (draw-1, unlimited passes, no undo) to calculate whether the 2x payout creates a +EV opportunity. The breakeven win rate is 50%. Academic research suggests theoretical solvability is \cf2 \strokec2 ~\cf5 \strokec5 82-91% but practical imperfect-information play drops to \cf2 \strokec2 ~\cf5 \strokec5 33-53% depending on player/solver sophistication.\
\
\cf2 \strokec2 ---\cf5 \strokec5 \
\

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ##\cf4 \strokec4  1xbet Ruleset (Exact Rules to Implement)
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Standard 52-card deck\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  7 tableau columns (1 to 7 cards each), top card face up, rest face down\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  4 foundation piles, built up by suit from Ace to King\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Draw 1 card at a time from stock pile\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Unlimited passes through the stock (can cycle as many times as needed)\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Tableau building: descending order, alternating colors\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Can move single cards or valid sequences between columns\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Only Kings can fill empty tableau columns\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  No undo functionality\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  No hints\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Win condition: all 52 cards moved to foundations\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Payout: 2x on win (bet $1, get $2 back), lose $1 on loss\
\
\cf2 \strokec2 ---\cf5 \strokec5 \
\

