\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ###\cf4 \strokec4  Is the 1xbet Shuffle Fair?
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  1xbet operates under a Cura\'e7ao license with no mandated independent RNG testing\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  Their solitaire is a proprietary "1xGames" title, not from a third-party audited provider\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  There is no way to verify shuffle randomness from outside\
\cf2 \strokec2 -\cf5 \strokec5  \cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 Possible test\cf2 \strokec2 **\cf5 \strokec5 : Play a large number of games and record every dealt card sequence. Run statistical tests (chi-squared, runs test, etc.) to check for non-random patterns. This requires building a card-reading overlay or manually logging deals.\
\

\f0\b \cf2 \strokec2 ###\cf4 \strokec4  Could an Automated Player Be Built?
\f1\b0 \cf5 \strokec5 \
